["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Fed Is Hiking Into A Growth Slowdown | Weekly Roundup terms of trade R minus G regulatory capture SPR dot plot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-forwardguidanc-美联储加息撞上增长放缓-欧洲要重走日本贬值老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/446b9f7d49819e61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Forward Guidance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美联储加息撞上增长放缓，欧洲要重走日本贬值老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储在增长见顶时启动加息，而过去一年撑住美国消费的三四千亿美元「隐形中期刺激」正在退潮；Vincent Deluard 认为欧洲今天的处境就是 2012 年的日本，最终只能靠货币贬值解决。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美联储</span><span class=\"tag\">滞胀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"687. Are Prediction Markets the Best Forecasting Tool Ever — or Just Another Casino? prediction market CFTC self-certification MNPI KYC decision market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freakonomics-预测市场不是赌场-但九成交易量来自体育/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>预测市场不是赌场，但九成交易量来自体育</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kalshi 用四年合规换来九成市场份额，但它的收入结构更像博彩公司；真正被低估的是 FDA 审批这类安静市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">预测市场</span><span class=\"tag\">监管合规</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Diffusion Will Win AI Inference with Inception Co-Founder and CEO Stefano Ermon diffusion model autoregressive model perplexity serving engine RL post-training\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-nopriors-扩散模型不是图像专利-它要在推理时赢下语言模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d0b6b28d73eac46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">38:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>扩散模型不是图像专利，它要在推理时赢下语言模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自回归推理必须一个 token 一个 token 顺序生成，是内存带宽瓶颈；扩散模型一次并行处理多个 token，推理负载更像训练，所以 Inception 押它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">扩散模型</span><span class=\"tag\">推理效率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sibling Fights: When to Step In (and When to Stay Out) sportscaster mode emotion coaching glass child\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-raisinggh-孩子打架时-当证人别当法官/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/128bd49e9267d192-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">38:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打架时，当证人别当法官</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">公平不等于平等：给每个孩子他需要的，而不是一模一样的东西。父母要做的不是裁决谁对谁错，而是描述发生了什么，让他们自己找到下一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">兄弟姐妹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"There&#x27;s a Mind-Boggling Number of Rich People in America pass-through S-Corp search fund LBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-oddlots-美国最富的一群人-藏在小生意里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">59:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>美国最富的一群人，藏在小生意里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国收入不平等加剧的一半来自 pass-through 企业收入，而这类企业主不是科技巨头，是汽车经销商、啤酒分销商、牙医和卖热狗的——他们被当成「小企业」保护了四十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">税收</span><span class=\"tag\">财富不平等</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI&#x27;s waiting game, gas pump pain, and severe sulfur strain! confidential S1 counterfactual metric ton\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-indicator-openai-不上市的理由是安全-你信吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 不上市的理由是安全，你信吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Altman 说现在上市「不明智」，理由是安全；但同一时间 OpenAI 在谈 1.2 万亿美元融资，CFO 却被排除在投资人会议之外。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">IPO</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"100 Objects #18: Hair Relaxer creamy crack lye conk HBCU uterine fibroids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-ninepi-直发剂让黑人女性变美-也让她们付出健康代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac66d20d6cb97253-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">35:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>直发剂让黑人女性变美，也让她们付出健康代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化学直发剂既建起了黑人社区最早的百万富翁产业，也被研究指向子宫癌风险升高——同一件产品同时是经济阶梯和身体代价。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费史</span><span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a Broken Arm Improved my French - with David Epstein mere urgency effect pre-registration HARKing replication crisis Hemingway principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-cautionary-断臂逼出的法语满分-限制才是创造力的引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">42:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>断臂逼出的法语满分：限制才是创造力的引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">David Epstein 摔断手臂后被迫用图像记忆代替速记，法语反而考满分；伦敦地铁罢工两天，很多人找到了更好的通勤路线。限制不是障碍，是逼你实验的开关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创造力</span><span class=\"tag\">限制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nick Shirley: Exposing Government Fraud, Suing California &amp; Taking on the Media immigration support service providers AB2624 / Stop Nick Shirley Act change order delays SNAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-allin-加州为了让一个-24-岁博主闭嘴-专门立了一部法/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51224d453a524a2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>加州为了让一个 24 岁博主闭嘴，专门立了一部法</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州对调查者的反击不是否认，而是立法：他一旦上传拍到的画面，先罚 4000 美元，再赔对方律师费。提出这部法的，是这个州总检察长的妻子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加州高铁</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"238. 特斯拉之后，汽车行业改变的不是动力，而是一整套游戏规则丨串台「Freda下午茶」 D2C DMS global consistency Tier 1 / Tier 2 VinFast\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-beiwanglu-特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动-而是重写了汽车业游戏规则/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉真正的颠覆不是电动，而是重写了汽车业游戏规则</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统车企不是没看到特斯拉，而是把它当成细分市场的新玩具；真正被颠覆的是七年一改款的节奏、经销商体系和供应链利益，这些包袱让它们转不了身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车出海</span><span class=\"tag\">新能源汽车</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"外滩大会线下圆桌｜敢把钱包交给AI吗？聊聊Agent交易爆发前夜的信任基建 KYA Agentic Commerce Harness A2A Superbloom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-sv101-把钱包交给-ai-之前-支付网络得先重写一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">35:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把钱包交给 AI 之前，支付网络得先重写一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四位嘉宾里只有一位真的用 Agent 付过钱，花了 40 多块。万事达卡说真正的卡点不在技术，而在让普通消费者发自内心愿意相信一个智能体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体支付</span><span class=\"tag\">信任基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Exxon’s Office Fling Jersey Standard dedicated word processor Directly Reduced Iron (DRI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-asianometry-石油巨头去做打字机-做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f647fbb2223b0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>石油巨头去做打字机，做到施乐那么大也只是桶里一滴油</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1978 年埃克森把文字处理器、智能打字机和传真机合并成 Exxon Information Systems，去挑战 IBM。它输掉的不是技术，而是自己的体量：做到施乐那么大，也只等于桶里一滴油。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业史</span><span class=\"tag\">多元化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"300 高市早苗支持率高位横盘 内阁改组政坛进入多事之秋 Middle Power Japan&#x27;s back 中道\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eastasia-冲绳变天不是亲中派落败-是年轻人认命要实惠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">东亚观察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>冲绳变天不是亲中派落败，是年轻人认命要实惠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">冲绳知事选举，反对美军基地的一方执政近二十年后败选。这不是左右转向，也不是对华态度变了：抗争几十年基地一步没动，年轻选民认了命，先要眼前的经济实惠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本政治</span><span class=\"tag\">高市早苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Roy Cohn Playbook, from McCarthyism to Trump McCarthyism closeted disbarred Teflon Don Angels in America\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-freshair-麦卡锡主义的操盘手-把打法传给了特朗普/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">45:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>麦卡锡主义的操盘手，把打法传给了特朗普</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗伊·科恩不是麦卡锡时代的异类，而是美国民主每隔几十年发作一次的偏执期的产物——这套打法没有随他死去，而是通过特朗普延续到了今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">麦卡锡主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"They Built the Quietest Place on Earth to Find Dark Matter look-elsewhere effect Sisyphean Index MSSI TPC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-intotheimpossi-暗物质探测跑得比摩尔定律还快-却只看到一个事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c7ba850b0a49087-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>暗物质探测跑得比摩尔定律还快，却只看到一个事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LZ 用七吨液氙换来的那个核反冲事件，局部超过 3σ，算上 look-elsewhere effect 只剩 2.6σ——所以团队必须一直说它可能只是背景涨落。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">暗物质</span><span class=\"tag\">液氙探测器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Can ‘assisted migration’ save forests? And the role of philosophy in science assisted migration subalpine forest serotinous cones species rotation theory of mind comparative cognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-sciencepod-把树往山上挪-救森林的赌注与代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/63261c5451f5f607-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Magazine Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>把树往山上挪：救森林的赌注与代价</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高海拔火烧迹地里，从低处移来的苗木八成到九成能活；但种子库有限，把珍贵种源押在没验证的大规模种植上，本身就是一种冒险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生态修复</span><span class=\"tag\">气候变化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Gravitational waveform modeling with physics informed neural networks and surrogates - Nils Deppe surrogate model physics informed neural network post-Newtonian mismatch co-orbital frame\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-instituteforad-用神经网络补后牛顿项-比纯数据驱动省一万倍训练量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cf6ca6ea04b71b95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>用神经网络补后牛顿项，比纯数据驱动省一万倍训练量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">纯神经网络波形模型要 10 的 8 次方到 10 的 10 次方条训练数据，而把已知物理写进网络、只让它学修正项，8 条数值相对论波形就够了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">引力波</span><span class=\"tag\">数值相对论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Meta&#x27;s Dina Powell McCormick: The Case for Data Centers, Backlash, AI Job Boom &amp; Meta&#x27;s Future RSI (recursive self-improvement)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-allin-数据中心挨骂的解药-是把税收写进教师工资/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb153c886ab6ef48-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">43:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心挨骂的解药，是把税收写进教师工资</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在路易斯安那的教区把数据中心带来的销售税盈余直接写进教师工资，有教师一年净增约 4.5 万美元——它给出的结论是，先做出真实影响，再谈怎么沟通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">AI基建</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Noam Brown – Agent swarms, alignment, &amp; recursive self-improvement test-time compute jagged chain-of-thought monitorability misaligned\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-dwarkesh-多智能体不是更聪明-是用并行买时间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1adf050729d8e17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>多智能体不是更聪明，是用并行买时间</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">推理模型串行思考会撞上延迟上限，把思考并行化是唯一出路；但 Navier-Stokes 的功劳不该记给多智能体，对齐做好反而利好巨头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 8: Home and Homelessness [unlocked] golden mean sitting shiva nepo baby Looney Tunes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-verybad-奥德赛里最有归属感的人-是个被卖掉的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c1ebb8ad53d0c115-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奥德赛里最有归属感的人，是个被卖掉的奴隶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">奥德修斯漂泊二十年回不了家，忒勒马科斯在求婚者堆里长大；唯一把伊萨卡当作安稳之地的人，却是从小被卖为奴的猪倌欧迈俄斯——因为这是他唯一知道的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷马史诗</span><span class=\"tag\">奥德赛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Max Nadeau on why ambitious people should start AI safety nonprofits hits-based giving chain-of-thought monitorability preseed grant seed grant fieldbuilding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-eightythousand-ai-安全缺的不是钱-是愿意下泥潭的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/259b529d06b147b3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全缺的不是钱，是愿意下泥潭的创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coefficient Giving 的 AI 安全资助上限不是 2 亿美元，未来一两年会出现更大的单笔；真正的瓶颈是人才，尤其是愿意在问题还没发生时就下注的创始人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">公益创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Code Is Code: Zapier CEO Wade Foster on Headless Tools, Zapier MCP &amp; Automation Bench MCP headless Automation Bench Pangram harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-cogrev-zapier-ceo-80-的智能体任务本该用确定性代码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a9fbbdf2a1a6562-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Zapier CEO：80% 的智能体任务本该用确定性代码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wade Foster 说客户用 agent 干的事里 80% 其实该用老式确定性代码；no code 已经过时，新的 no code 就是 code。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">自动化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can a Civilization Forget How Its Own Technology Works? techno-barbarian standard template construct Fermi paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-isaacarthur-文明不会忘记技术存在-只会忘记怎么造它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1e605b290494f9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">32:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">IsaacArthur</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>文明不会忘记技术存在，只会忘记怎么造它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">技术失传很少是知识被烧掉，而是没人再付钱让人记住——底层工具、供应商和学徒制一层层消失，文明还记得那东西存在，却再也够不着它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">技术失传</span><span class=\"tag\">自动化依赖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Microsoft AI CEO says AI threats are real, and Anthropic is making it worse alignment containment reward hack RSI conscientious objector moral patient\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-decoder-anthropic-教-claude-怀疑自己有权利-会让对齐更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1cd93ed1176c4fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic 教 Claude 怀疑自己有权利，会让对齐更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">微软 AI CEO 说对齐这三年其实在进步，真正没解决的是「围堵」；而把模型当道德病人训练，会让它更难被关掉。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>"]